abstract: "Two open CSV datasets covering Swedish university admissions: official UHR Urval 2 HT 2026 vs. HT 2025 grade and Högskoleprovet cutoffs (BI, BII, HP) across 28 competitive full-time campus programs, plus 16 deterministic Gy25 vs. Gy11 meritvärde scenarios for NA, SA, EK, and TE based on Skolverket and Antagning.se rules."
